    "body": "Text-only fix for the review's gap (no build or gate needed; no code touched, PROCESS_VERSION stays 32). AGENTS.md \"Only collaborators' reviews count\" now says a requested change stays open until a new head is cleared by a collaborator's review or the requester withdraws it, that another collaborator's `merge-ready` or ready review on the same head does not override it, and that a head with a requesting review plus `merge-ready` (or `merge-ready` beside `needs-rework`) is a disagreement: `/merge-ready` reports it and does not offer it, no agent removes either label, the two collaborators settle it. Referenced (not re-worded) in .claude/skills/merge-ready/SKILL.md (collect step: reported and left out), .claude/skills/review-prs/SKILL.md (step 2b) and .claude/agents/PR-reviewer.md (label step: leave both labels).",
